WEBVTT

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:08.920
Mom?

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:33.050
<b>Tsugumomo</b>

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:33.050
<b>Tsugu</b>

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:44.500
m 0 0 l 0 -10 l 10 -10 l 10 0

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:44.500
m 0 0 l 0 -10 l 10 -10 l 10 0

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:44.500
<b>Chapter 12</b>

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:44.490
<b>Decision</b>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:43.670
"Decision."

00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:50.500
Y'know, I've been waiting for 
this moment for a long time.

00:01:51.090 --> 00:01:54.400
The moment when I get to experience 
the thrill of fighting you.

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:59.010
I have to... kill... my mom?

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:03.540
Well, it's been a while,

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:05.770
so why don't we all get reacquainted?

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:07.570
You!

00:02:08.430 --> 00:02:10.270
You'll pay for what you did to Miurahi-sama!

00:02:10.970 --> 00:02:12.770
Oh, I should thank you!

00:02:12.990 --> 00:02:15.560
I'm back on my feet again because of this.

00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:18.830
But now that I have it, I don't need you.

00:02:18.830 --> 00:02:21.030
Get in my way and I'll have to break you.

00:02:22.540 --> 00:02:24.030
Enough talk.

00:02:24.340 --> 00:02:26.040
Give that back!

00:02:28.270 --> 00:02:29.210
Oh?

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:39.180
Monster...

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:44.680
Kanaka...

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:46.180
Kazuya!

00:02:47.090 --> 00:02:48.430
You must run, Kazuya!

00:02:49.050 --> 00:02:50.050
You can't...

00:02:50.630 --> 00:02:52.810
You don't stand a chance against Kanaka.

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:54.380
Kiriha-san?

00:02:58.710 --> 00:03:01.320
<i>How is she so strong?</i>

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:04.240
<i>We were watching the future...</i>

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:07.620
<i>But we never even saw her move.</i>

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:10.250
<i>And all... barehanded?</i>

00:03:18.110 --> 00:03:18.840
Brother!

00:03:19.410 --> 00:03:20.590
We can't.

00:03:22.100 --> 00:03:23.340
No matter what we do,

00:03:23.830 --> 00:03:25.350
we won't win.

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:26.950
Run, Kazuya!

00:03:26.950 --> 00:03:28.770
We can at least make sure you...

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:29.730
He cannot leave.

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:31.350
There is no turning back.

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:34.910
Their goal is nothing short 
of killing Kazuya-san.

00:03:34.910 --> 00:03:37.360
We should put an end to this now.

00:03:37.770 --> 00:03:40.880
We will fight first and keep her from moving.

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:44.630
You will then have to finish 
her off permanently.

00:03:44.630 --> 00:03:46.330
You must make sure she dies!

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:48.180
Wow, what's with you guys?

00:03:48.180 --> 00:03:52.370
This reunion's been a long time coming, 
but no one's happy to see me?

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:56.750
I've always felt guilty for 
what happened to you, Kanaka.

00:03:57.120 --> 00:03:59.120
Then do me a favor and butt out?

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:01.760
I'm way overdue for some family time.

00:04:02.460 --> 00:04:07.280
But first... would you mind undoing 
the seal you put on Kazuya?

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:09.960
I want to fight my real son.

00:04:10.710 --> 00:04:13.200
I will do no such thing, 
nor allow such a fight.

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:15.960
Kazuya-san will only be 
landing the killing blow.

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:17.240
Oh, okay!

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:20.530
So I get to fight the rest of you first, then?

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:21.450
Correct.

00:04:21.450 --> 00:04:23.280
If we're going up against Kanaka-chan,

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:25.730
we'd better bust out all the stops.

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:27.370
Adamantine Pillar!

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:30.410
There's still more!

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:32.910
<b>Kanayama Hexagonal Adamantine Pillar</b>

00:04:31.340 --> 00:04:32.910
Adamantine Battering Ram!

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:35.720
Very nice!

00:04:35.720 --> 00:04:37.240
You're up, Azami-chan!

00:04:39.010 --> 00:04:40.170
Here I come!

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:44.050
Old Bell!

00:04:46.020 --> 00:04:47.300
Weather Bag:

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:49.810
<b>Weather Bag: Lightning Trident</b>

00:04:47.670 --> 00:04:49.410
Lightning Trident!

00:04:50.580 --> 00:04:51.670
That was a close one!

00:04:51.670 --> 00:04:52.810
Kanaka-sama!

00:04:54.930 --> 00:04:56.810
Sumeragi Sunao is here to face you!

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:02.570
Sunao-chan, you've really grown up!

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:04.240
I've still got more!

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:05.570
Come, Kotetsu!

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:06.070
Right!

00:05:08.510 --> 00:05:10.060
Oh, wow!

00:05:10.060 --> 00:05:12.830
And that's Divine Possession?!

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:15.520
Show me what you've got, Sunao-chan!

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:18.940
War God Strike!

00:05:17.850 --> 00:05:19.340
<b>War
God
Strike</b>

00:05:22.870 --> 00:05:24.040
Did that do it?

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:24.720
Not yet.

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:28.960
She didn't even dodge... 
She stood and deflected it!

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:31.180
That's crazy!

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:34.480
Adamantine Hammer!

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:37.280
Weather Bag: Torrential Homing Hail!

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:37.850
Hup!

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:41.610
From greatest heights, at the summit 
of the holy white mountain...

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:44.170
To this place, ebbing and waning,

00:05:44.170 --> 00:05:46.900
the snake that rises from the
riverside to offer last rites...

00:05:48.350 --> 00:05:50.020
Everflowing Serpent!

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:56.120
That's not gonna work this time, either!

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:57.080
Watershed!

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:09.010
Adamantine Pillar!

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:09.010
Weather Bag!

00:06:12.990 --> 00:06:14.260
Armor-Piercing Stream!

00:06:14.260 --> 00:06:15.880
Deicidal Ice!

00:06:30.830 --> 00:06:32.780
Kazuya-san, this is your chance!

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:33.930
Kazuya...

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:35.960
Quickly!

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:38.790
Her arms are bare...

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:33.090
This'll be the second time 
we've fought one-on-one, huh?

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:35.780
I really got my butt kicked last time.

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:39.130
It took me until today to recover!

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:41.100
I wonder how it'll go this time.

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:43.180
The result won't change.

00:07:43.610 --> 00:07:45.110
This ends now.

00:08:17.320 --> 00:08:18.760
Sledgehammer Weave!

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:21.390
Enlarged!

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:27.060
Fist of the Water God's ultimate technique...

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:30.010
Moonglade Guanyin!

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:30.530
<b>Moonglade Guanyin</b>

00:08:30.830 --> 00:08:32.170
There it is!

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:33.860
That's how you got me last time.

00:08:34.270 --> 00:08:35.450
I'd better get ready!

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:39.090
Twelve-Layered Power Obi!

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:39.790
<b>Twelve-Layered Power Obi</b>

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:41.820
<i>The same technique from before...</i>

00:08:42.550 --> 00:08:44.410
<i>Then the outcome won't change!</i>

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:08.250
What happened?

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:18.740
Since the day you beat me, Kukuri-chan...

00:09:19.770 --> 00:09:22.860
Half of Azami has remained in this town.

00:09:24.450 --> 00:09:30.820
My consciousness was hazy, but I was able to 
watch Kazuya's battles through her eyes...

00:09:32.140 --> 00:09:35.880
Which is why things are going 
to be different this time.

00:09:51.350 --> 00:09:52.610
Divine Possession.

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:08.840
Kokuyou, don't!

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:20.260
Kokuyou-san!

00:10:20.260 --> 00:10:21.250
Well, then...

00:10:23.090 --> 00:10:24.480
You ready?

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:38.320
Say, Kiriha-chan...

00:10:41.830 --> 00:10:44.210
If... hypothetically, okay?

00:10:44.820 --> 00:10:48.330
If something happens to me, 
please take care of Kazuya.

00:10:50.650 --> 00:10:53.610
Oh, please, you're practically invincible!

00:10:55.290 --> 00:10:56.340
I'm not.

00:10:57.850 --> 00:11:00.240
All right, as you wish.

00:11:00.240 --> 00:11:03.100
I'll protect Kazuya, should it come to that.

00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:05.860
Kiriha-chan...

00:11:07.900 --> 00:11:08.850
Thank you.

00:11:11.260 --> 00:11:12.580
Kanaka...

00:11:13.660 --> 00:11:16.210
Kiriha-san... I...

00:11:16.210 --> 00:11:18.280
No one can blame you for being confused.

00:11:19.170 --> 00:11:22.290
Kukuri and I didn't explain what happened.

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:25.120
But I can promise you this...

00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:29.240
That isn't Kanaka anymore.

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:32.780
It's the amasogi you created.

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:36.130
And it has to be defeated!

00:11:39.770 --> 00:11:40.780
Okay.

00:11:44.310 --> 00:11:45.640
Divine Possession!

00:12:00.630 --> 00:12:01.900
No good.

00:12:02.590 --> 00:12:06.490
I thought the two of you 
might have what it takes...

00:12:07.350 --> 00:12:08.460
but you don't.

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:12.700
I guess I'll keep my promise 
to Azami-chan, then.

00:12:28.210 --> 00:12:29.450
Kazuya...

00:12:31.010 --> 00:12:32.890
Kiriha-san?

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:46.300
Kiriha-san! Kiriha-san! Kiriha-san!

00:12:50.780 --> 00:12:52.160
Hold it!

00:12:55.060 --> 00:12:58.540
You're not killing Ya-kun, you old bitch!

00:12:58.820 --> 00:13:00.550
S-Sis?

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:04.050
Get a grip, Ya-kun! I'll manage somehow!

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:07.300
You will? Seriously, Kasumi-chan?

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:10.350
Things are different now!

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:11.060
Saori!

00:13:14.330 --> 00:13:17.190
The drain... from Divine Possession...

00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:19.190
I can buy you three years!

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:22.940
You have to get stronger than her by then!

00:13:26.110 --> 00:13:27.800
Sis...

00:13:51.710 --> 00:13:52.810
Kiriha-san?

00:13:54.610 --> 00:13:55.650
Sis?

00:13:57.500 --> 00:13:59.730
Kukuri-chan? Kokuyou-san?

00:14:01.030 --> 00:14:03.730
Sunao-san... Kotetsu-kun?

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:06.930
Kazuya!

00:14:12.110 --> 00:14:13.410
Dad?

00:14:14.030 --> 00:14:17.370
Have you seen the others? I can't find them.

00:14:17.900 --> 00:14:20.880
Have a seat. We need to talk.

00:14:21.410 --> 00:14:22.180
Okay.

00:14:30.450 --> 00:14:31.750
Uh...

00:14:31.750 --> 00:14:34.570
Introduce yourself to our guest.

00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:37.190
It's nice to meet you.

00:14:37.790 --> 00:14:40.950
I am the head of the malison exorcist 
training school Tsuzuraden,

00:14:40.950 --> 00:14:42.900
Oriobana Ouhi.

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:45.910
It's nice to meet you. I'm Kagami Kazuya.

00:14:45.910 --> 00:14:47.680
Nice to see you again.

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:49.150
Bakura-chan!

00:14:49.460 --> 00:14:53.660
So, what's all this about? Where is everyone?

00:14:54.270 --> 00:14:56.660
You seem to be a bit confused.

00:14:58.030 --> 00:15:00.860
What do you remember before falling asleep?

00:15:01.490 --> 00:15:03.170
What do I remember?

00:15:03.620 --> 00:15:08.630
Well, Mom came back to 
life at Hakusan Shrine...

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:11.600
She killed Kukuri-chan and Kiriha-san...

00:15:12.270 --> 00:15:14.450
And then my sister showed up...

00:15:15.580 --> 00:15:20.440
Wow, that's gotta be a dream. 
I must not be fully awake!

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:23.060
Everything you just said really happened.

00:15:25.410 --> 00:15:28.900
I understand. Allow me 
to explain what happened.

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:32.160
For now, the threat has passed...

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:38.890
Well, it would be more accurate 
to say that it has been postponed.

00:15:41.910 --> 00:15:43.000
From the look of things...

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:45.780
We were too late.

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:50.530
We need to ascertain what happened here. 
Work in teams of two.

00:15:50.530 --> 00:15:53.770
Search the area and aid the injured,

00:15:53.770 --> 00:15:56.350
and restrain the tsukumogami from Mayoiga.

00:15:57.250 --> 00:16:01.070
This shape... Is it one of 
the Mayoiga tsukumogami?

00:16:01.070 --> 00:16:02.600
Not at all.

00:16:05.860 --> 00:16:07.290
And you are?

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:11.610
Kagami Kasumi's tsukumogami, 
Saori the hourglass.

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:18.010
Pardon my rudeness. I am the head 
of Tsuzuraden, Oriobana Ouhi.

00:16:18.510 --> 00:16:20.870
Can you explain what happened here?

00:16:21.380 --> 00:16:23.370
By all means!

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:25.880
Hold it!

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:31.810
By the time Kasumi-sama and I arrived, 
the battle had nearly concluded.

00:16:26.530 --> 00:16:29.130
You're not killing Ya-kun, you old bitch!

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:33.660
I can buy you three years!

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:37.640
You have to get stronger than her by then!

00:16:46.830 --> 00:16:50.050
Huh? She's not moving fast 
enough to evade, and yet...

00:16:50.580 --> 00:16:53.040
Is this her tsukumogami power?

00:16:58.690 --> 00:17:01.660
As the sands of time cease their dance...

00:17:02.030 --> 00:17:02.910
Is this...

00:17:03.130 --> 00:17:05.050
Let the the flow of time be dammed!

00:17:06.030 --> 00:17:07.620
Enshrined Moment!

00:17:08.860 --> 00:17:13.690
To stop Kanaka, Kasumi-sama 
and I deployed a barrier.

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:19.800
Kanaka, her tsukumogami Azami,

00:17:19.920 --> 00:17:27.440
Kasumi-sama, and myself are now trapped 
inside a frozen moment for three years.

00:17:27.710 --> 00:17:31.380
Then I'm not actually speaking to you?

00:17:31.380 --> 00:17:35.950
Exactly! I'm an illusion, 
left behind to explain what happened.

00:17:36.970 --> 00:17:38.010
I understand.

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:44.440
I'll leave exorcists from Tsuzuraden 
to monitor the situation, as well.

00:17:44.440 --> 00:17:46.280
We appreciate it.

00:17:52.630 --> 00:17:55.640
That's what happened after 
you lost consciousness...

00:17:55.640 --> 00:17:58.450
And that was three days ago.

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:04.090
Your sister has bought you valuable time.

00:18:04.620 --> 00:18:08.730
You now have two years and 362 days.

00:18:09.260 --> 00:18:10.460
Sis...

00:18:11.010 --> 00:18:13.980
Wait, what happened to the others?

00:18:14.430 --> 00:18:17.080
Sumeragi Sunao-san and 
Kotetsu-kun aren't hurt.

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:19.800
They're at home, on standby.

00:18:20.250 --> 00:18:25.920
Yagokoro-sama and Kanayama-sama 
were badly injured,

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:28.500
but are recuperating at 
their respective shrines.

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:32.110
Kokuyou-san's injuries 
aren't life-threatening,

00:18:32.110 --> 00:18:36.260
and she's being treated by staff from 
the main hall of Hakusan Shrine.

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:38.130
Hakusan Shrine...

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:39.510
Then what about Kukuri-chan?

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:44.330
Kukurihime-sama has passed away.

00:18:53.550 --> 00:18:56.030
Kiriha-san! What about Kiriha-san?!

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:58.500
I need you to remain calm, Kazuya.

00:19:01.230 --> 00:19:02.360
This is Kiriha-san.

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:21.610
Kazuya-san...

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:28.730
I wish that I could give you more time, 
but I'm afraid that's not an option.

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:33.650
We cannot ignore an aberration 
with the strength to kill a god.

00:19:34.260 --> 00:19:36.640
The fight against Kanaka 
is a foregone conclusion.

00:19:37.270 --> 00:19:41.560
But... even if the greatest 
fighters from Tsuzuraden

00:19:41.560 --> 00:19:44.420
were able to slay her in three years' time,

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:49.990
the malison atonement would 
cause a calamity in this town.

00:19:49.990 --> 00:19:55.440
There is only one way avoid that: 
you must defeat Kanaka.

00:19:57.010 --> 00:20:01.200
That is why you must train at 
Tsuzuraden until that day comes.

00:20:01.710 --> 00:20:04.340
Your father has already given his approval.

00:20:04.700 --> 00:20:06.850
I'm afraid you have no choice in the matter.

00:20:08.030 --> 00:20:11.930
But... I would still rather 
you choose to come.

00:20:13.550 --> 00:20:17.540
Kagami Kazuya-san... what will you do?

00:20:51.940 --> 00:20:55.900
With the loss of people so close to him, 
at the hands of his own mother...

00:20:56.450 --> 00:20:59.250
I thought convincing him 
would be more difficult.

00:20:59.250 --> 00:21:01.370
It seems I underestimated him.

00:21:04.030 --> 00:21:06.810
I'm going to go with Ouhi-san.

00:21:07.300 --> 00:21:08.290
I see.

00:21:09.340 --> 00:21:11.300
You knew everything, didn't you?

00:21:12.350 --> 00:21:13.410
I did.

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:15.680
Thank you.

00:21:17.580 --> 00:21:20.120
Kiriha-san and Kukuri-chan... everyone...

00:21:20.620 --> 00:21:22.170
They did so much for me.

00:21:23.130 --> 00:21:25.570
So now it's my turn to give back.

00:21:26.700 --> 00:21:27.620
I see.

00:21:30.050 --> 00:21:30.860
Kazuya...

00:21:32.900 --> 00:21:34.050
Take care of Kanaka.

00:21:38.270 --> 00:21:39.190
Right.

00:21:40.100 --> 00:21:43.940
I was sure Kazuya-san would 
rise to the challenge.

00:21:44.620 --> 00:21:46.700
Do you know him well?

00:21:47.090 --> 00:21:50.340
People reveal their true 
selves in their dreams.

00:21:51.370 --> 00:21:52.770
Sorry about the wait.

00:21:54.100 --> 00:21:57.090
I'll be in your care for 
the next three years.

00:21:58.110 --> 00:21:58.800
Of course.

00:22:00.410 --> 00:22:04.240
I'm going to stop Mom.

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Illustration by: Hamada Yoshikazu</b>
